      "claim": "In consumer electronics, \"fair trade\" can refer to adherence to ethical sourcing standards (fair wages, conflict‑free minerals) that are recognised by certifications such as Fair for Life, B‑Corp, or Fairtrade‑certified raw materials, not only the strict Fairtrade International agricultural label.",
