      "claim": "A laptop model that is marketed and certified as meeting those fair‑trade criteria exists.",
      "evidence": "Fairphone announced the \"Fairbook\" laptop, which incorporates Fairtrade‑certified gold and other ethically sourced components, and the product is presented on the Fairphone website as a \"fair‑trade laptop\".",
